  "details": "You have to manually respawn them each time you go through a portal or change worlds. This is simply unacceptable.\n\n\"but instances that have items disabled make this complicated uwu\", you say, vrc dev.\n\nSimple, just have an \"automatically spawns\" toggle for certain items. Each time the user enters an instance, if the instance is set to have items allowed, anything with this toggle flipped will then automatically spawn.\n\nWe might present this toggle to the user as a \"follows you between worlds\" checkbox.",
